      "share_beats_size_beta not finite -> beta_unresolved; <= majority -> beta_not_separated",
      "exposure fixed -> selection",
      "exposure varies: path share (size x exposure) > maj AND path share (size x beta) > maj -> selection; else timing evidence rule (unchanged)"
